'''Electric Diva Strikes!''' (塗襲！電子の歌姫 ''Nuri Kasane！ Denshi no Utahime'') is a [[Hatsune Miku Collaboration Event|Hatsune Miku]] collaboration stage added in [[Version 10.1 Update|version 10.1]]. This [[Gauntlet]] features many enemies from the collab.

==Overview==
===About===
Electric Diva Strikes! contains a total of 20 [[No Continues]] levels. After beating three stages, the player must wait for 90 minutes before they may proceed to the next one (30 minutes for one available). Rewards for the first completion of a stage can include XP, [[Battle Items]], [[Cat Capsule|Tickets]] and [[Cat Energy|Leaderships]]. The rewards reset with every appearance of the event.

===Stage Battlegrounds===
:''See [[Electric Diva Strikes!/Song 1~20]].''

==Play Requirements==
*Electric Diva Strikes! is unlocked after clearing [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 1.

